## What V13 delivers (commit 639a92c)
- `src/agent/quickEdit.ts`: conservative classifier. Measured scope wins (text-only or pure reorder,
  within limits) -> fast model; behavioural / structural / file-boundary / oversized / multi-file /
  ambiguous -> base model. Short instructions classified by narrow-vs-big patterns in English and
  Arabic; ambiguous or long instructions stay on the base model.
- `resolveQuickEditModel` uses the configured fast tier (`fallbackModel`), falling back to the base
  model when it is unset; `planQuickEditRoute` adds a minimal targeted-edit instruction (English +
  Arabic) only for the quick route.
- `planTargetedDiff(before, after)` turns a before/after pair into line-anchored patches (replacement,
  deletion, insertion, insert-before-first-line) via the now-exported `diffLines`/`DiffSummary`/`DiffHunk`.
- Arabic/RTL: narrow-edit instructions are recognised in Arabic, `hasRtlScript` detects RTL script,
  and a targeted patch preserves Arabic text exactly (covered by tests).
- `src/agent/loop.ts` and `src/agent/orchestrator.ts`: optional per-run `model` override so the
  quick-edit route can actually run on the fast model; `src/index.ts` passes it through.

